# Override global ~/.gitignore_global — this is a static site repo,
# we need html/css/js/png/etc to commit.
!*.html
!*.css
!*.js
!*.json
!*.png
!*.jpg
!*.jpeg
!*.svg
!*.txt
!*.ico

# Wrangler's local cache — holds wrangler-account.json (Cloudflare account ID).
# Never commit it. The tracked worker/wrangler.toml is config only, no secrets.
.wrangler/
